      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rule that carries the weight: only the Risk Engine may open a connection to the Execution\nService (VAULT). BC12 Portfolio Construction and the Model Registry sit in CORE and are\nsubject to the identical rule \u2014 neither can reach VAULT under any configuration.",
      "fontSize": 12,
